msgctxt "[\"RPCS3\",\"rpcs3_sv.ts\",\"Tooltips\\n\",\"523\",\"e65d288260a8ee034e9d6e00\"]"
msgid ""
"Changes the scale of emulated system time.\n"
"Affects software which uses system time to calculate things such as dynamic timesteps."
msgstr ""
"Ändrar skalan för emulerad systemtid.\n"
"Påverkar program som använder systemtid för att beräkna exempelvis dynamiska tidssteg."

# Review: e731d8429caf7ebcc19c9789
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/077dbd51ae33cf5f98922160d291d06231dd426b/RPCS3/rpcs3_sv.ts
# Evidence-SHA256: 9ebe7dd49ad1e88dcd75476c940db214c0fc7dcab76a75147d068ab0b83b5bbc
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: review-commit
#. Review-note (JSON): "Bilingual translation changed in reviewed commit: l10n: review Swedish RPCS3 GPU settings"
msgctxt "[\"RPCS3\",\"rpcs3_sv.ts\",\"Tooltips\\n\",\"439\",\"e731d8429caf7ebcc19c9789\"]"
msgid ""
"Obey RSX memory tiling configuration when writing GPU data to vm memory.\n"
"This can fix graphics corruption observed when Read Color or Read Depth options are enabled."
msgstr ""
"Följ RSX-konfigurationen för minnesindelning vid skrivning av GPU-data till VM-minnet.\n"
"Detta kan rätta grafikfel som uppstår när alternativen Läs färg eller Läs djup är aktiverade."

# Review: ea2c4a99bfdbd758061cba61
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/e2a2b5690820a868c9d758eb6a9d21b062968050/RPCS3/rpcs3_sv.ts
# Evidence-SHA256: 63b5ab3ff6727c5203a2ac0881ce17c2a243e49283c930300bf7dd33fe248369
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: review-commit
#. Review-note (JSON): "Bilingual translation changed in reviewed commit: l10n: review Swedish RPCS3 audio settings"
msgctxt "[\"RPCS3\",\"rpcs3_sv.ts\",\"Tooltips\\n\",\"577\",\"ea2c4a99bfdbd758061cba61\"]"
msgid ""
"When enabled, SPU performance is measured at runtime.\n"
"Enable only at a developr's request because when enabled it reduces performance a bit by itself."
msgstr ""
"När detta är aktiverat mäts SPU-prestandan under körning.\n"
"Aktivera endast på begäran av en utvecklare eftersom funktionen i sig minskar prestandan något."

# Review: eb4dff2bd0e84034675d9098
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/c08b6a02a3fc50117282590d04b53101c736376b/RPCS3/rpcs3_sv.ts
# Evidence-SHA256: b0a3fb5d948e97c6bfd34984b1ea36688f4ef17b540c1f1297cebd5e32b29f88
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: review-commit
#. Review-note (JSON): "Bilingual translation changed in reviewed commit: l10n: review Swedish RPCS3 timing settings"
msgctxt "[\"RPCS3\",\"rpcs3_sv.ts\",\"Tooltips\\n\",\"551\",\"eb4dff2bd0e84034675d9098\"]"
msgid ""
"Disables Fast Math for MSL shaders, which may violate the IEEE 754 standard.\n"
"Disabling it may fix some artifacts, especially on Apple GPUs, at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"Inaktiverar Fast Math för MSL-shaderprogram, vilket annars kan bryta mot standarden IEEE 754.\n"
"Att inaktivera det kan rätta vissa artefakter, särskilt på Apple-GPU:er, på bekostnad av prestanda."

# Review: fbcd5d3e08c1a586cdebc1ff
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/c08b6a02a3fc50117282590d04b53101c736376b/RPCS3/rpcs3_sv.ts
# Evidence-SHA256: b0a3fb5d948e97c6bfd34984b1ea36688f4ef17b540c1f1297cebd5e32b29f88
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: review-commit
#. Review-note (JSON): "Bilingual translation changed in reviewed commit: l10n: review Swedish RPCS3 timing settings"
msgctxt "[\"RPCS3\",\"rpcs3_sv.ts\",\"Tooltips\\n\",\"485\",\"fbcd5d3e08c1a586cdebc1ff\"]"
msgid ""
"Limits the maximum number of SPURS threads in each thread group.\n"
"May improve performance in some cases, especially on systems with limited number of hardware threads.\n"
"Limiting the number of threads is likely to cause crashes; it's recommended to keep this at the default value."
msgstr ""
"Begränsar det högsta antalet SPURS-trådar i varje trådgrupp.\n"
"Kan förbättra prestandan i vissa fall, särskilt på system med få hårdvarutrådar.\n"
"En begränsning av antalet trådar kan orsaka krascher; det rekommenderas att behålla standardvärdet."
